        <p><seg source="#source-9086-9092">――</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9092-9116"><rb>紅花</rb><rt>べにばな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9116-9119">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9119-9134"><rb>苗</rb><rt>なへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9134-9155">や、おしろいの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9155-9170"><rb>苗</rb><rt>なへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9170-9178">――</seg></p>
