        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35889-35901"><rb>魔</rb><rt>ま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-35901-35910">ものの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35910-35925"><rb>鳥</rb><rt>とり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-35925-35943">が、そこを、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35943-35958"><rb>窓</rb><rt>まど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-35958-35979">をのぞくやうに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35979-35991"><rb>鳴</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-35991-36018">いたのである。――</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36018-36033"><rb>晝</rb><rt>ひる</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36033-36045"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-36045-36051">た、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36051-36066"><rb>坂</rb><rt>さか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-36066-36069">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36069-36093"><rb>砂道</rb><rt>すなみち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-36093-36102">には、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36102-36117"><rb>青</rb><rt>あを</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-36117-36129">すすき、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36129-36147"><rb>蚊帳</rb><rt>かや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-36147-36153">つり</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36153-36168"><rb>草</rb><rt>ぐさ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-36168-36174">に、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36174-36189"><rb>白</rb><rt>しろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-36189-36192">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36192-36207"><rb>顏</rb><rt>かほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-36207-36219">の、はま</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36219-36243"><rb>晝顏</rb><rt>ひるがほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-36243-36246">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36246-36258"><rb>目</rb><rt>ま